===Verb===
{{en-verb|*}}

# To [[collapse]] [[inward]] or [[downward]].
#: {{syn|en|break|crush|give way|stave|stave in}}
#: {{ux|en|The roof '''caved in''' under the weight of the snow.}}
#: {{ux|en|He '''caved-in''' the side of the barrel with a single well-placed kick.}}
# {{lb|en|figurative}} To [[relent]]; to [[grant]] [[approval]] against one's initial will.
#: {{syn|en|assent|give in|give up|relinquish|yield|comply|acquiesce}}
#: {{ux|en|After he asked me a few times, I finally '''caved in''' and had a slice of cake.}}

